{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00750","headline":"郊庙歌辞 享文敬太子庙乐章 迎俎酌献 · 冯伉","name":"郊庙歌辞 享文敬太子庙乐章 迎俎酌献","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"撰日瞻景，诚陈乐张。\n礼容秩秩，羽舞煌煌。\n肃将涤濯，祗荐芬芳。\n永锡繁祉，思深飨尝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"冯伉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00750.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00750","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}